*
* Diode Sim Model Produced by Altium Ltd
* Date:  21-Mar-2003
*
* Manufacturer: Philips
* Component Name: PMBD6050
*
* This macromodel models the effect of carrier recombination-generation
* and high-level injection on the diode.
*
*Note: This macromodel derived from data sheets and pspice models obtained from Philips Semiconductor.

.SUBCKT PMBD6050 10 30
D1 10 20 DIDEAL
D2 10 20 DRECOMB
D3 20 30 DHIGH

* Subcircuit models
.MODEL DIDEAL D
+(
+  IS =  6.0289E-09
+  N =  2.1283
+  TT =  4.5E-09
+  CJO =  5.9363E-13
+  VJ =  0.68774
+  M =  0.1
+  BV =  139.42
+  IBV =  3.45E-02
+)

.MODEL DHIGH D
+(
+  IS =  0.0375
+  N =  2.1283
+  RS =  0.001
+)

.MODEL DRECOMB D
+(
+  IS =  5E-10
+  N =  2.133547047
+)

.ENDS PMBD6050








